      "side": 1,
      "message": "So in order to use the experimental console, you need to be running the EC-3PO interperter and console. Commands get sent in an encapsulated form to the EC and the console utility (ec/util/ec3po/console.py) does the presentation of the console. I would think you want to add this feature there instead.\n\nBut also your commit message says that you won\u0027t be running servod, therefore you won\u0027t be running EC-3PO at all.\n\nFor more info about EC-3PO, see https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/HEAD/docs/ec-3po-design.md.",
      "revId": "d49fcfc6ab2b1b85c6c5689c48baf2949046b527",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
